<h2>{% trans %}Goal{% endtrans %}</h2>
<p>{% trans %}Configure Webhook.{% endtrans %}</p>
<h2>{% trans %}What is bunny webhook?{% endtrans %}</h2>
<p>{% trans %}Bunny provides the functionality for webhooks to provide information about video status: <a href="https://docs.bunny.net/docs/stream-webhook">Webhooks documentation</a>.{% endtrans %}</p>
<h2>{% trans %}Steps{% endtrans %}</h2>
<ol>
  <li>{% trans %}Go to {{ config_link }}.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}In Bunny dashboard go to Stream -> Your Library -> API.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Copy the "Read-only API key" to the library in the {{ config_link }}. Bunny signs webhook requests with it, and requests without a valid signature are rejected.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Put "example.com/bunny-stream/webhook" in "Webhook URL".{% endtrans %}</li>
</ol>
